                                        "serial": "container_containertooltip_66acfa2dd2660918546750",
                                        "body": "After CSS 2.1, the scope of the specification increased significantly and the progress on different CSS modules started to differ so much, that it became more effective to develop and release recommendations separately per module. Instead of versioning the CSS specification, W3C now periodically takes a snapshot of the latest stable",
