                                    "body": {
                                        "serial": "container_containertooltip_66acfa2dd27a4743035149",
                                        "body": "This module carries on where CSS first steps left off \u2014 now you've gained familiarity with the language and its syntax, and got some basic experience with using it, it's time to dive a bit deeper. This module looks at the cascade and inheritance, all the selector types we have available, units, sizing, styling backgrounds and borders, debugging, and lots more.",
